  "question": "What park can I find within 90 kilometers when heading from Country Inn & Suites, Springfield, IL toward Illinois Central Depot, Bethany, IL?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.608253 39.757227)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.739562 39.646085)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE leisure = 'park'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.608253 39.757227)',4326)::geography, 90000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-89.608253 39.757227)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
